  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">(39 fotos)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">La noche de este jueves se ha celebrado en Man&aacute; Bar, en la calle 8 de Marzo de Onda, una cena de maridaje, preparada por el chef Daniel Rodr&iacute;guez Castro, con vinos de bodegas Den&eacute;bola, representada por Alfredo Fenollosa. </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/05/P1600607.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Aunque la raz&oacute;n social de la bodega est&aacute; en Val&egrave;ncia, los vi&ntilde;edos pertenecen a la denominaci&oacute;n de origen Ribera del Duero.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparmaridatgemanabar250517/p1600566.jpg\" alt=\"p1600566\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparmaridatgemanabar250517/p1600568.jpg\" alt=\"p1600568\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparmaridatgemanabar250517/p1600570.jpg\" alt=\"p1600570\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparmaridatgemanabar250517/p1600571.jpg\" alt=\"p1600571\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparmaridatgemanabar250517/p1600572.jpg\" alt=\"p1600572\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparmaridatgemanabar250517/p1600573.jpg\" alt=\"p1600573\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparmaridat